script = ExtResource("1_o7jf5")
job_id = &"j0001"
job_name = "Fortress"
job_description = "An iron wall to keep Lamentations at bay. 

The Fortress vocation excels at defending the party from physical attacks. Taking hits from enemies repeatedly will also accumulate a resource called [b]Ire[/b] which can be used to trigger powerful counter-attacks. 

While the Fortresses' shields can protect against magic attacks to some degree, they are not as well suited for foes that deal elemental damage."
